## Summary

- **ColourSwatches component** (`overrides/app/components/product-view/colourSwatches/`) — a paginated radiogroup of swatch-viewType product images for the PDP. AC1–AC5 complete: single-colour shows label only; colours without a resolved swatch image or with `orderable: false` are withheld entirely; selection updates `?color=` in the URL, which `useDerivedProduct` picks up via `usePDPSearchParams` to resolve the active variant
- **`suppressColourAttribute` prop** on `ProductView` — lets the PDP skip the built-in SwatchGroup for colour without affecting non-PDP consumers (cart quick-add, wishlist, bonus-product); `SFCC_COLOUR_ATTRIBUTE_ID` replaces 5 bare `'color'` string literals
- **Co-located css.ts recipe** (`colourSwatches.css.ts`, `ZimmColourSwatches`) registered in `theme/components/index.ts`, following the `footerNavColumn` pattern — all colour/spacing via `var(--zimm-*)` tokens
- **`afterContent` slot** on `StaticProductHeader` — injects the `ColourSwatches` instance into the PDP header below `ZimmProductContent`, keeping layout ownership in the header partial

